ayout="true"><div id="pdp-about-this-product-section" class="flex flex-col mt-40 w-full scroll-mt-[92px]"><span class="H2-Bold text-color-UIText1Display">About this product</span><div class="expandableSection-AfpLUG"><div class="sectionHeader-mTOhOt clickable-Q3abyt"><span class="H3-Bold text-color-UIText1Display">Highlights</span><div class="chevronIcon-ckYHO1"><svg fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 48 48" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" font-size="20px"><path d="m24 19.25 13.67 13.67a1 1 0 0 0 1.41 0l1.84-1.84a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.41L24.71 13.46a1 1 0 0 0-1.42 0L7.1 29.66a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42l1.83 1.84a1 1 0 0 0 1.41 0L24 19.25Z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="sectionContent-GpwgDO px-24"><div class="flex flex-col gap-12"><div class="flex items-start"><span class="text-color-UIText1 mx-8 flex-shrink-0" style="font-size:16px">•</span><span class="text-color-UIText1 break-words" style="font-size:16px">Fast &amp; even warmth with no cold spots plus dual-zone heating for personalized comfort</span></div><div class="flex items-start"><span class="text-color-UIText1 mx-8 flex-shrink-0" style="font-size:16px">•</span><span class="text-color-UIText1 break-words" style="font-size:16px">8 heat levels (90°F–125°F) and 8 timer settings (1–8 hours) with memory function for easier repeat use</span></div><div class="flex items-start"><span class="text-color-UIText1 mx-8 flex-shrink-0" style="font-size:16px">•</span><span class="text-color-UIText1 break-words" style="font-size:16px">Auto shut-off and built-in overheat protection for added safety</span></div><div class="flex items-start"><span class="text-color-UIText1 mx-8 flex-shrink-0" style="font-size:16px">•</span><span class="text-color-UIText1 break-words" style="font-size:16px">Plush 630 GSM bubble faux fur with a silky-soft 230 GSM milk velvet reverse side</span></div><div class="flex items-start"><span class="text-color-UIText1 mx-8 flex-shrink-0" style="font-size:16px">•</span><span class="text-col