13.3333px))"/><img class="descriptionImage-mNxo82 mb-8 rounded-12" src="https://p16-oec-general.ttcdn-us.com/tos-alisg-i-aphluv4xwc-sg/1cafad0efbb040829175a39cef852948~tplv-fhlh96nyum-resize-webp:600:450.webp?dr=12185&amp;t=555f072d&amp;ps=933b5bde&amp;shp=c940a200&amp;shcp=9b759fb9&amp;idc=useast5&amp;from=3376456192" alt="Cozy Style Soft and Warm Heated Blanket Throw, Bubble Faux Fur Electric Throw Blanket, Fast Heating, 8 Heat Levels, 8 Timer Settings, Auto Shut-Off, Overheat Protection, ETL Listed, 50&quot;x60&quot;, Cream White" title="Cozy Style Soft and Warm Heated Blanket Throw, Bubble Faux Fur Electric Throw Blanket, Fast Heating, 8 Heat Levels, 8 Timer Settings, Auto Shut-Off, Overheat Protection, ETL Listed, 50&quot;x60&quot;, Cream White" loading="lazy" width="600" height="450" style="aspect-ratio:1.3333333333333333;max-width:max(0px, calc(133.3333vh - 213.3333px))"/><div class="flex"><span class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal flex-shrink-0 mr-4" style="font-size:16px">·</span><div class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal min-w-0" style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-weight:700;color:#000000">Fast &amp; Even Warmth: </span><span style="font-weight:400;color:#000000">This heated blanket uses advanced heating technology to deliver fast, even warmth with no cold spots. Choose from 8 heat levels (90°F–125°F) and 8 timer settings (1–8 hours) for personalized comfort. The memory function remembers your last settings for effortless use, while the</span><span style="font-weight:700;color:#000000"> </span><span style="font-weight:400;color:#000000">84&quot; × 90&quot; size features dual-zone heating, so you can each enjoy your preferred warmth</span></div></div><div class="flex"><span class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal flex-shrink-0 mr-4" style="font-size:16px">·</span><div class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal min-w-0" style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-weight:700;color:#000000">Safety You Can Trust: </span><span style="font-weight:400;color:#000000">ETL Listed &amp; FCC Compliant for reliable safety and performance. Built-in overheat protection helps prevent excessive heat, while the adjustable 1–8 hour auto shut-off adds an extra layer of protection. Enjoy the cozy warmth of this electric blanket with greater peace of mind</span></div></div><div class="flex"><span class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal flex-shrink-0 mr-4" style="font-size:16px">·</span><div class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal min-w-0" style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-weight:700;color:#000000">Luxurious 630 GSM Bubble Faux Fur:</span><span style="font-weight:400;color:#000000"> Wrap yourself in plush 630 GSM faux rabbit fur featuring an elegant bubble texture for a luxurious look and irresistibly soft feel. The reverse side features silky-soft 230 GSM milk velvet for cozy comfort on both sides—perfect for the couch, bed, or chilly nights</span></div></div><div class="flex"><span class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal flex-shrink-0 mr-4" style="font-size:16px">·</span><div class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal min-w-0" style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-weight:700;color:#000000">A Gift of Warmth &amp; Style:</span><span style="font-weight:400;color:#000000"> Give the gift of cozy comfort with this heated throw blanket, combining luxurious softness, elegant style, and comforting warmth. Perfect for Christmas, birthdays, housewarmings, and other special occasions, it’s a thoughtful gift for mom, wife, daughter, granddaughter, or anyone special</span></div></div><div class="flex"><span class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal flex-shrink-0 mr-4" style="font-size:16px">·</span><div class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal min-w-0" style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-weight:700;color:#000000">Machine Washable &amp; Easy Care:</span><span style="font-weight:400;color:#000000"> Simply detach the controller before washing. Machine wash cold and tumble dry low to keep your blanket fresh, soft, and cozy for everyday comfort. Do not iron</span></div></div><div class="flex"><span class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal flex-shrink-0 mr-4" style="font-size:16px">·</span><div class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal min-w-0" style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-weight:400;color:#000000">Cozy Bliss Heated Blanket Throw, Bubble Faux Fur Electric Blanket, Fast Heating, 8 Heat Levels &amp; 8 Timer Settings, Auto Shut-Off &amp; Overheat Protection, ETL Listed, 50&quot;x60&quot;, Cream White, Dark Grey</span></div></div></div><div class="cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-center w-full mt-20"><span class="Headline-Semibold text-color-UIText1 rounded-8 background-color-UIShapeNeutral4 px-24 py-13">View more</span></div><div class="absolute bottom-60 left-0 right-0 h-60 bg-gradient-to-t from-white to-transparent pointer-events-none" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 0%, #FFFFFF 100%"></div></div></div></div><div class="expandableSection-AfpLUG"><div class="sectionHeader-mTOhOt clickable-Q3abyt"><span class="H3-Bold text-color-UIText1Display">Introduction</span><div class="chevronIcon-ckYHO1"><svg fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 48 48" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" font-size="20px"><path d="m24 19.25 13.67 13.67a1 1 0 0 0 1.41 0l1.84-1.84a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.41L24.71 13.46a1 1 0 0 0-1.42 0L7.1 29.66a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42l1.83 1.84a1 1 0 0 0 1.41 0L24 19.25Z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="sectionContent-GpwgDO px-24"><div class="text-color-UIText1 break-words leading-relaxed" style="font-size:16px">Cozy Bliss Heated Blanket Throw is a corded electric throw designed to bring fast, even warmth to your couch or bed. It uses advanced heating technology to help deliver consistent comfort with no cold spots, and it includes dual-zone heating so you and a partner can choose different preferred warmth settings. 

Customize your comfort with 8 heat levels (90°F–125°F) and 8 timer settings (1–8 hours). For convenience, the memory function remembers your last settings, making it easy to return to your preferred warmth. For additional peace of mind, the heated throw features built-in overheat protection and an adjustable auto shut-off.

Wrapped in luxurious 630 GSM bubble faux fur with a silky-soft 230 GSM milk velvet reverse side, this cozy cream white throw (50&quot;x60&quot;) is made for everyday relaxation. When it’s time to refresh, detach the controller and machine wash cold, then tumble dry low; do not iron. ETL Listed and FCC Compliant.</div><div class="flex items-center mt-16 cursor-pointer text-color-UIText3"><svg fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 48 48" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" font-size="16px"><path d="M24 6a18 18 0 1 0 0 36 18 18 0 0 0 0-36ZM2 24a22 22 0 1 1 44 0 22 22 0 0 1-44 0Zm25-8a3 3 0 1 1-6 0 3 3 0 0 1 6 0Zm-4 6a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V23a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-2Z"></path></svg><span class="P3-Regular ml-4">This information is AI generated</span></div></div></div><div class="expandableSection-AfpLUG"><div class="sectionHeader-mTOhOt clickable-Q3abyt"><span class="H3-Bold text-color-UIText1Display">Question and answer</span><div class="chevronIcon-ckYHO1"><svg fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 48 48" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" font-size="20px"><path d="m24 19.25 13.67 13.67a1 1 0 0 0 1.41 0l1.84-1.84a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.41L24.71 13.46a1 1 0 0 0-1.42 0L7.1 29.66a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42l1.83 1.84a1 1 0 0 0 1.41 0L24 19.25Z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="sectionContent-GpwgDO px-24"><div class="flex flex-col gap-16"><div class="flex items-start"><span class="text-color-UIText1 mx-8 flex-shrink-0" style="font-size:16px">•</span><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="font-semibold text-color-UIText1 mb-4" style="font-size:16px">What type of blanket is Cozy Bliss Heated Blanket Throw?
A:It is a bubble faux fur electric heated blanket throw with a controller.</div><div class="text-color-UIText2 break-words" style="font-size:16px"></div></div></div><div class="flex items-start"><span class="text-color-UIText1 mx-8 flex-shrink-0" style="font-size:16px">•</span><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="font-semibold text-color-UIText1 mb-4" style="font-size:16px">How big is the heated blanket throw and what color is it?
A:The size is 50&quot;x60&quot; and the color is Cream White.</div><div class="text-color-UIText2 break-words" style="font-size:16px"></div></div></div><div class="flex items-start"><span class="text-color-UIText1 mx-8 flex-shrink-0" style="font-size:16px">•</span><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="font-semibold text-color-UIText1 mb-4" style="font-size:16px">What heating controls does it offer?
A:It provides 8 heat levels (90°F–125°F) and 8 timer settings (1–8 hours), and it includes a memory function that remembers your last settings.</div><div class="text-color-UIText2 break-words" style="font-size:16px"></div></div></div><div class="flex items-start"><span class="text-color-UIText1 mx-8 flex-shrink-0" style="font-size:16px">•</span><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="font-semibold text-color-UIText1 mb-4" style="font-size:16px">What safety features are included?
A:It features built-in overheat protection and an adjustable 1–8 hour auto shut-off, and it is ETL Listed and FCC Compliant.</div><div class="text-color-UIText2 break-words" style="font-size:16px"></div></div></div><div class="flex items-start"><span class="text-color-UIText1 mx-8 flex-shrink-0" style="font-size:16px">•</span><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="font-semibold text-color-UIText1 mb-4" style="font-size:16px">What materials are used on each side of the throw?
A:One side is 630 GSM bubble faux fur, and the reverse side is silky-soft 230 GSM milk velvet.</div><div class="text-color-UIText2 break-words" style="font-size:16px"></div></div></div><div class="flex items-start"><span class="text-color-UIText1 mx-8 flex-shrink-0" style="font-size:16px">•</span><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="font-semibold text-color-UIText1 mb-4" style="font-size:16px">How do I wash the heated blanket throw?
A:Detach the controller before washing. Machine wash cold and tumble dry low; do not iron.</div><div class="text-color-UIText2 break-words" style="font-size:16px"></div></div></div></div><div class="flex items-center mt-16 cursor-pointer text-color-UIText3"><svg fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 48 48" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" font-size="16px"><path d="M24 6a18 18 0 1 0 0 36 18 18 0 0 0 0-36ZM2 24a22 22 0 1 1 44 0 22 22 0 0 1-44 0Zm25-8a3 3 0 1 1-6 0 3 3 0 0 1 6 0Zm-4 6a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V23a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-2Z"></path></svg><span class="P3-Regular ml-4">This information is AI generated</span></div></div></div><div class="expandableSection-AfpLUG"><div class="sectionHeader-mTOhOt clickable-Q3abyt"><span class="H3-Bold text-color-UIText1Display">Safety &amp; compliance</span><div class="chevronIcon-ckYHO1"><svg fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 48 48" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" font-size="20px"><path d="m24 19.25 13.67 13.67a1 1 0 0 0 1.41 0l1.84-1.84a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.41L24.71 13.46a1 1 0 0 0-1.42 0L7.1 29.66a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42l1.83 1.84a1 1 0 0 0 1.41 0L24 19.25Z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="sectionContent-GpwgDO px-24"><div class="flex flex-col gap-20"><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="text-color-UIText1 Headline-Semibold"><span style="font-weight:600;color:#000000">Seller information</span></div><div class="text-color-UIText1 Headline-Regular flex"><span class="text-color-UIText1 mx-8 flex-shrink-0" style="font-size:16px">•</span><div class="min-w-0"><span style="font-weight:400;color:#000000">Business name: Shanghai Sunwin Lohas Trading Co.,Ltd</span></div></div><div class="text-color-UIText1 Headline-Regular flex"><span class="text-color-UIText1 mx-8 flex-shrink-0" style="font-size:16px">•</span><div class="min-w-0"><span style="font-weight:400;color:#000000">Business address (This address has been automatically translated for your convenience):Shanghai,China</sp