64402b5b45601c59d11a9~tplv-fhlh96nyum-resize-webp:600:450.webp?dr=12185&t=555f072d&ps=933b5bde&shp=c940a200&shcp=9b759fb9&idc=useast5&from=3376456192","https:\u002F\u002Fp19-oec-general.ttcdn-us.com\u002Ftos-alisg-i-aphluv4xwc-sg\u002F43e5b1260b564402b5b45601c59d11a9~tplv-fhlh96nyum-resize-webp:600:450.webp?dr=12185&t=555f072d&ps=933b5bde&shp=c940a200&shcp=9b759fb9&idc=useast5&from=3376456192"]}},{"type":"image","image":{"width":600,"height":450,"uri":"tos-alisg-i-aphluv4xwc-sg\u002F1cafad0efbb040829175a39cef852948","url_list":["https:\u002F\u002Fp16-oec-general.ttcdn-us.com\u002Ftos-alisg-i-aphluv4xwc-sg\u002F1cafad0efbb040829175a39cef852948~tplv-fhlh96nyum-resize-webp:600:450.webp?dr=12185&t=555f072d&ps=933b5bde&shp=c940a200&shcp=9b759fb9&idc=useast5&from=3376456192","https:\u002F\u002Fp19-oec-general.ttcdn-us.com\u002Ftos-alisg-i-aphluv4xwc-sg\u002F1cafad0efbb040829175a39cef852948~tplv-fhlh96nyum-resize-webp:600:450.webp?dr=12185&t=555f072d&ps=933b5bde&shp=c940a200&shcp=9b759fb9&idc=useast5&from=3376456192"]}},{"type":"ul","content":["Fast & Even Warmth: This heated blanket uses advanced heating technology to deliver fast, even warmth with no cold spots. Choose from 8 heat levels (90°F–125°F) and 8 timer settings (1–8 hours) for personalized comfort. The memory function remembers your last settings for effortless use, while the 84\" × 90\" size features dual-zone heating, so you can each enjoy your preferred warmth","Safety You Can Trust: ETL Listed & FCC Compliant for reliable safety and performance. Built-in overheat protection helps prevent excessive heat, while the adjustable 1–8 hour auto shut-off adds an extra layer of protection. Enjoy the cozy warmth of this electric blanket with greater peace of mind","Luxurious 630 GSM Bubble Faux Fur: Wrap yourself in plush 630 GSM faux rabbit fur featuring an elegant bubble texture for a luxurious look and irresistibly soft feel. The reverse side features silky-soft 230 GSM milk velvet for cozy comfort on both sides—perfect for the couch, bed, or chilly nights","A Gift of Warmth & Style: Give the gift of cozy comfort with this heated throw blanket, combining luxurious softness, elegant style, and comforting warmth. Perfect for Christmas, birthdays, housewarmings, and other special occasions, it’s a thoughtful gift for mom, wife, daughter, granddaughter, or anyone special","Machine Washable & Easy Care: Simply detach the controller before washing. Machine wash cold and tumble dry low to keep your blanket fresh, soft, and cozy for everyday comfort. Do not iron","Cozy Bliss Heated Blanket Throw, Bubble Faux Fur Electric Blanket, Fast Heating, 8 Heat Levels & 8 Timer Settings, Auto Shut-Off & Overheat Protection, ETL Listed, 50\"x60\", Cream White, Dark Grey"],"rich_content":[{"text_alignment":1,"template":"{{RmFzd_0}}{{RmFzd_1}}{{RmFzd_2}}{{RmFzd_3}}","arguments":{"{{RmFzd_0}}":{"text_attribute":{"text":"Fast & Even Warmth: ","font":{"font_weight":3,"font_class":5}}},"{{RmFzd_1}}":{"text_attribute":{"text":"This heated blanket uses advanced heating technology to deliver fast, even warmth with no cold spots. Choose from 8 heat levels (90°F–125°F) and 8 timer settings (1–8 hours) for personalized comfort. The memory function remembers your last settings for effortless use, while the","font":{"font_weight":1,"font_class":5}}},"{{RmFzd_2}}":{"text_attribute":{"text":" ","font":{"font_weight":3,"font_class":5}}},"{{RmFzd_3}}":{"text_attribute":{"text":"84\" × 90\" size features dual-zone heating, so you can each enjoy your preferred warmth","font":{"font_weight":1,"font_class":5}}}},"text_attribute":{"font":{"font_weight":1,"font_class":4},"font_color":{"color":"#FF000000"}}},{"text_alignment":1,"template":"{{U2FmZ_0}}{{U2FmZ_1}}","arguments":{"{{U2FmZ_0}}":{"text_attribute":{"text":"Safety You Can Trust: ","font":{"font_weight":3,"font_class":5}}},"{{U2FmZ_1}}":{"text_attribute":{"text":"ETL Listed & FCC Compliant for reliable safety and performance. Built-in overheat protection helps 